sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Service
  participant DB as Database
  participant R as OutboxRelay
  participant P as EventPublisher
  S->>DB: BEGIN, business rows plus outbox_event PENDING, COMMIT
  loop every 1 s
    R->>DB: find due ids (PENDING and due, or PROCESSING with expired lease), max 50
    R->>DB: claim one row: compare-and-set UPDATE to PROCESSING with 60 s lease, attempts + 1
    R->>P: publish outside any DB transaction
    P-->>R: ok (local listeners, or broker confirm)
    R->>DB: mark SENT
  end
  Note over R,P: failure: back to PENDING with backoff 2 s doubling to 5 min, FAILED after 8 attempts. Crash after publish gives duplicate delivery, so consumers dedupe by eventId
